                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ce851041-4290-3829-991a-47cb4a5398f5",
                                        "entry_id": "b73b92af-f841-38e9-b04f-e754b2927d15",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to comparison."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b1243ee-bbe4-4ef4-978f-b5f14c30f7d1",
                                                "sense_id": "ce851041-4290-3829-991a-47cb4a5398f5",
                                                "text": "He gave us a comparative example to illustrate how the human mind works."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5bffeaa4-e9f7-482e-9ea2-4fec619a7b9c",
                                                "sense_id": "ce851041-4290-3829-991a-47cb4a5398f5",
                                                "text": "that kind of animals that have the comparative faculty, by which they compare things together, deliberate and resolve."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1056015a-eb92-3689-ad81-183bfe60b105",
                                        "entry_id": "b73b92af-f841-38e9-b04f-e754b2927d15",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Using comparison as a method of study, or founded on something using it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "986584b2-55f2-43e4-a5a0-02658958597f",
                                                "sense_id": "1056015a-eb92-3689-ad81-183bfe60b105",
                                                "text": "A comparative study between Homo Sapiens and Homo neanderthalensis."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7dcc7572-84d3-4c11-bc84-1e4dc513462e",
                                                "sense_id": "1056015a-eb92-3689-ad81-183bfe60b105",
                                                "text": "comparative anatomy"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "943c14c6-2356-49fc-8a00-8866648b0219",
                                                "sense_id": "1056015a-eb92-3689-ad81-183bfe60b105",
                                                "text": "After all, it is undeniable that the B.R. standard coach scored highly in comparative trials with other European railway vehicles on the Continent a few years ago, so that B.R. civil engineers must share responsibility for any defects in its behaviour over here."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "00232e50-248a-3624-b387-ed6e193fb84a",
                                        "entry_id": "b73b92af-f841-38e9-b04f-e754b2927d15",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Approximated by comparison; relative."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0b283b5-d07f-4472-b67d-21d1f3d102a2",
                                                "sense_id": "00232e50-248a-3624-b387-ed6e193fb84a",
                                                "text": "The Olympics, the weather and a comparative lack of heavyweight clashes so far this season have been cited as reasons for the drop in viewers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8bd662c2-94b3-4569-81b9-fc22a72ab60a",
                                                "sense_id": "00232e50-248a-3624-b387-ed6e193fb84a",
                                                "text": "The recurrence of comparative warmth and cold."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5bdc70f1-33fb-405c-bf98-6c6f9a464f58",
                                                "sense_id": "00232e50-248a-3624-b387-ed6e193fb84a",
                                                "text": "This bubble, […] by reason of its comparative levity to the fluid that encloses it, would necessarily ascend to the top."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d8dca48-b1e3-3225-9bda-b7a60388e80e",
                                        "entry_id": "b73b92af-f841-38e9-b04f-e754b2927d15",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Comparable; bearing comparison."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea2cb019-ff39-411f-b83b-145c000521ae",
                                                "sense_id": "6d8dca48-b1e3-3225-9bda-b7a60388e80e",
                                                "text": "And need he had of slumber yet, for none / Had suffered more—his hardships were comparative / To those related in my grand-dad's Narrative."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "comparative",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bc9bcdf2-dd4b-3553-ac70-2e52452a248c",
                                        "entry_id": "c253aab8-46ac-3664-af87-64d8009a2b4d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The degree of comparison of an adjective or adverb used when comparing two entities in terms of a certain property or a certain way of doing something. In English, the comparative of superiority is formed by adding the suffix -er or the word more (e.g. bigger, more fully); the comparative of equality, by adding the word as (e.g. as big, as fully); the comparative of inferiority, by adding the word less (e.g. less big, less fully)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50e61741-c888-3ac2-9cb3-f6be0e0ac29a",
                                        "entry_id": "c253aab8-46ac-3664-af87-64d8009a2b4d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An adjective or adverb in the comparative degree."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1dfe84bf-861f-3047-8eba-3dad5dffbed4",
                                        "entry_id": "c253aab8-46ac-3664-af87-64d8009a2b4d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Data used to make a comparison."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "in-plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
