                                                "sense_id": "1dfe84bf-861f-3047-8eba-3dad5dffbed4",
                                                "text": "Investment ratios are positive. Comparative or trend data are required to draw final conclusions. The absence of comparatives and trend data constrains the conclusions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24451933-474f-3d69-954d-a92490419ccd",
                                        "entry_id": "c253aab8-46ac-3664-af87-64d8009a2b4d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An equal; a rival; a compeer."
